operations.specification:
Query shopping_mall_inventory_histories table filtering by shopping_mall_product_variant_id and inventory history id.
Return all fields: id, shopping_mall_product_variant_id, quantity_delta, reason, created_at, updated_at.
Filter out records where deleted_at is not null (soft deleted).
Use joins with shopping_mall_product_variants if necessary for validation or authorization.
Handle errors with appropriate not found responses if ids do not exist.
This is a read-only operation.

Use Prisma Client:

const inventoryHistory = await prisma.shopping_mall_inventory_histories.findFirst({
  where: {
    id: inventoryHistoryId,
    shopping_mall_product_variant_id: variantId,
    deleted_at: null,
  },
});

if (!inventoryHistory) {
  throw new NotFoundException();
}

return inventoryHistory;

