   * Errors occur if the specified product does not exist or is deleted.
   *
   * Related operations to manage product images include:
   *
   * - GET /shoppingMall/seller/products/{productId}/images for listing images
   * - PUT /shoppingMall/seller/products/{productId}/images/reorder to update image order
