   * Handle authorization: only sellers with approved status or administrators may upload images.
   * Reject requests for products that are soft-deleted or do not exist.
   * Handle concurrency in displayOrder to avoid conflicts.
   * Ensure displayOrder uniqueness per product to maintain consistent gallery order.
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
